        "text": "The case South Florida Water Management District v. Miccosukee Tribe concerns whether the S\u20119 water\u2011control pump must obtain a Section\u202f402 permit under the Clean Water Act."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "South Florida Water Management District",
        "citations": [
